  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the annotation agent. The brick README names the upstream source as the JRC TSAR database (https://tsar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/); the repository's own MIT LICENSE covers only the brick tooling, not the data. No TSAR-specific data license statement could be retrieved (the TSAR legal notice is not exposed in fetched page text), so the general European Commission reuse policy was applied: EU-owned content is licensed CC BY 4.0 under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU. Classed attribution / commercial permitted on that basis. HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED: confirm the TSAR page's specific legal notice, and confirm what data the brick actually packages (README + MIT license only on disk); some TSAR records reference third-party test-method submissions whose rights may differ.",
